            "custom_code": "",
            "title": "Year-on-year benchmarking",
            "description": "<p>With each annual analysis, you build a time series: trends in colonization, contamination, and response to management. Over time, this becomes one of the most powerful tools you have for keeping your orchard on track.</p>",
